[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="FloorTheme" load_steps=4 format=3]

; Cloud Operations. Sealed concrete and rows of blades, deliberately the lightest and warmest
; environment in the game — see the palette note in `tools/generate_art.py` for why a floor
; following the near-black Data Center has to move, and why nothing on this one is green.

